@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

# Log in via auth.http first — the access_token cookie authenticates these requests.
# Replace the ids below with real resume ids from the list call.
@resumeId = paste-resume-id-here
@unanalysedResumeId = paste-resume-id-here
@otherUsersResumeId = paste-resume-id-here
@noTextResumeId = paste-resume-id-here

### List resumes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes

### Analyse a resume — first call performs the AI analysis
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/analyse

### Analyse again — returns the stored profile, no provider call
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/analyse

### Force re-analysis — spends a fresh provider call, updates the row in place
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/analyse?force=true

### Get the stored Developer Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/analysis

### Analysis for a resume that has never been analysed -> 404 ANALYSIS_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{unanalysedResumeId}}/analysis

### Another user's resume -> 404 RESUME_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{otherUsersResumeId}}/analyse

### A resume whose text extraction failed -> 422 CONTENT_TEXT_MISSING
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{noTextResumeId}}/analyse
